    "text": "県議会の答弁を即日でnoteに上げるチャレンジ1日目\n<https://note.com/atsushi_iwanaga/n/ne8aae7356e69|https://note.com/atsushi_iwanaga/n/ne8aae7356e69>",
    "team": "T08FL58DC9K",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "image_url": "https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/214119264/rectangle_large_type_2_f7772de87b58ff8a3daf1c6320b2341d.png?fit=bounds&quality=85&width=1280",
